{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56405","headline":"谢姚月华遗石华诗 · 杨达","name":"谢姚月华遗石华诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青袿仙女隔蓬莱，珠树金窗向晓开。\n燕子羽毛非广袖，殷勤也带石花来。\n（《琅嬛记》卷中引《本传》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}